      },
      "Artefact of the Vaults§Arae-Shrike": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Infantry"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Enemy units that are set up on the battlefield as Reinforcements cannot be set up within 12\" of this unit."
      },
      "Artefact of the Vaults§Auriferous Orb": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Infantry"
          ]
        },
        "rules": {
          "AddWeapon": {
            "actions": [
              {
                "actionType": "add",
                "iterations": 1,
                "paths": [
                  [
                    "{parent}",
                    "traits"
                  ]
                ],
                "value": "Ranged Weapon§Auriferous Orb"
              }
            ],
            "evals": [],
            "evaluate": "AND",
            "failState": "pass"
          }
        },
        "text": "The bearer is equipped with the following ranged weapon in addition to its other weapons:\n\nBlinding Light: Each time a unit is hit by this weapon, it is blinded until the start of your next turn. While a unit is blinded, each time a model in that units makes an attack, subtract 1 from the Hit roll."
      },
      "Artefact of the Vaults§Epoch Auspice": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Infantry"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Once per battle, at the start of the battle round, the bearer can deploy the Epoch Auspice. If it does, until the end of the battle round, each time an attack targets the bearer’s unit, subtract 1 from the Wound roll."
      },
      "Artefact of the Vaults§Mortis Gyre": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Infantry"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Once per battle, when the bearer is selected to fight, it can activate the Mortis Gyre. If it does, until that fight is resolved, melee attacks made by this model that target an INFANTRY unit have the [DEVASTATING WOUNDS] ability."
      },
      "Artefact of the Vaults§Pareldor's Caducatrix": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Infantry"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Once per battle, in your Command phase, the bearer can regain up to D6 lost wounds."
      },
      "Artefact of the Vaults§Twilight Pallium": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Infantry"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Once per battle, at the end of any of your phases, the bearer can use the Twilight Pallium. If it does, remove the bearer’s unit from the battlefield and set it up again anywhere on the battlefield more than 3\" horizontally away from all enemy units. The bearer’s unit is not eligible to charge in a turn in which it was set up in this manner unless it is more than 9\" horizontally away from all enemy units."
      },
      "Battle Scar§Immediate Threats": {
        "stats": {
          "Crusade Pts": {
