            "tracked": true,
            "value": -1,
            "visibility": "normal"
          }
        },
        "text": "In your Charge phase, each time this unit declares a charge, you can only select the closest enemy unit as the target of that charge.\nEach time a model in this unit makes a melee attack, you can re-roll a Wound roll of 1."
      },
      "Battle Scar§Lions. Not Wolves": {
        "stats": {
          "Crusade Pts": {
            "statType": "numeric",
            "tracked": true,
            "value": -1,
            "visibility": "normal"
          }
        },
        "text": "This unit loses its Martial Ka'tah ability.\nEach time a model in this unit makes a melee attack, you can re-roll a Hit roll of 1 and you can re-roll a Wound roll of 1."
      },
      "Battle Scar§Sense of Insufficiency": {
        "stats": {
          "Crusade Pts": {
            "statType": "numeric",
            "tracked": true,
            "value": -1,
            "visibility": "normal"
          }
        },
        "text": "Change the Objective Control characteristic of models in this unit to 0. It cannot be increased by any means.\nEach time this unit is selected to fight, both Ka'tah Stances are active for this unit, instead of only one."
      },
