        "text": "**MORITOI ANCIENTS**\n\n- While a friendly **ADEPTUS CUSTODES DREADNOUGHT** unit is at **starting strength**, that unit has +2 **OC**.\n\n- While a friendly **ADEPTUS CUSTODES DREADNOUGHT** unit is below **starting strength**, that unit’s attacks can re-roll **hit rolls** of 1.\n\n- While a friendly **ADEPTUS CUSTODES DREADNOUGHT** unit is **below half-strength**, that unit’s attacks can:\n\n-  Re-roll **hit rolls** of 1.\n\n-  Re-roll **wound rolls** of 1.",
        "rules": {
