        "stats": {
          "Detachment Points": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**SILENT SISTERHOOD**\n\n- When mustering your army, you can select a friendly **ANATHEMA PSYKANA CHARACTER** model to be your **WARLORD**.\n\n- Friendly **PROSECUTOR SQUAD** units have **BATTLELINE**.\n\n- Friendly **ANATHEMA PSYKANA** units have the following ability:\n\n**Creeping Dread (Aura):** In the Battle-shock step of your opponent’s Command phase, each enemy unit within 12\" of this unit that is a **PSYKER** unit/below **starting strength** makes a **battle-shock roll**, with -1 to that **battle-shock roll**."
      },
      "Detachment§Shield Host": {
        "keywords": {
