        "stats": {
          "Detachment Points": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**Martial Mastery**\n\nAt the start of the battle round, you can select one of the bullet points below. If you do, until the start of the next battle round, that bullet point’s effects apply.\n\n\n*  Each time an **Adeptus Custodes** model from your army with the Martial Ka’tah ability makes a melee attack, a succesful unmodified Hit roll of 5+ scores a Critical Hit.\n\n*  Improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of melee weapons equipped by **Adeptus Custodes** models from your army with the Martial Ka’tah ability by 1."
      },
      "Detachment§Silent Hunters": {
        "keywords": {
          "Role": [
            "Reconnaissance"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Detachment Points": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "WARNING: this detachment was not in 10e and needs importing.\n\n**Skin-crawling Disorientation**\n- When a friendly **Anathema Psykana** unit is selected to make an **advance move**, that **advance move** does not prevent that unit from being **eligible to start an action**.\n\n- Friendly **Anathema Psykana** units have the following ability:\n\n**Ceaseless Vigilance:** In your Shooting phase, this unit can select one **visible** enemy unit within 12\". That enemy unit is **nulled**: \n\n- While a unit is **nulled**, that unit has +3\" **detection range**."
      },
