      "Stratagem§Anathema Blademastery": {
        "keywords": {
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "Adeptus Custodes",
            "Null Maiden Vigil"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase, when a friendly **VIGILATOR SQUAD** unit is **selected to fight**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **VIGILATOR SQUAD** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit’s attacks have: \n\n- **[SUSTAINED HITS 1]**\n\n- __Or:__ **[LETHAL HITS]**."
      },
      "Stratagem§Arcane Genetic Alchemy": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Adeptus Custodes",
            "Shield Host"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Any"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s",
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {}
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Any phase, just after a mortal wound has been allocated to an **Adeptus Custodes** model from your ability (excluding **Anathema Psykana** models).\n\n**TARGET**: That **Adeptus Custodes** model’s unit.\n\n**EFFECT**: Until the end of the phase, models in your unit have the Feel No Pain +4 ability against mortal wounds."
      },
      "Stratagem§Archeotech Munitions": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Adeptus Custodes",
            "Shield Host"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Wargear"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET**: One **Adeptus Custodes** unit from your army (excluding **Anathema Psykana** units) that has not been selected to shoot this phase.\n\n**EFFECT**: Select either the [LETHAL HITS] or [SUSTAINED HITS 1] ability. Until the end of the phase, ranged weapons equipped by models in your unit have the selected ability."
      },
      "Stratagem§Avenge the Fallen": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Adeptus Custodes",
            "Honoured Companions"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase, when a friendly **TRUSTED SENTINEL** unit that is below **starting strength** is **selected to fight**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **TRUSTED SENTINEL** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit’s melee attacks (excluding those made by **CHARACTER** models) have +2 **A**."
      },
      "Stratagem§Emperor’s Executioners": {
        "keywords": {
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s",
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "Adeptus Custodes",
            "Talons of the Emperor"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Start of the Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET**: Up to two **ADEPTUS CUSTODES** units from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time a model in one of your units targets an enemy unit that is below its Starting Strength, add 1 to the Wound roll.\n\n**RESTRICTIONS**: You can only select two units if one (and only one) of them is an **ANATHEMA PSYKANA** unit and both are within 6″ of each other."
      },
      "Stratagem§Emperor's Vengeance": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Solar Spearhead"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s",
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET**: One Adeptus Custodes unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT**: Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit is destroyed, if that model has not fought this phase, roll one D6, adding 1 to the result if your unit has the Walker keyword. On a 4+, do not remove it from play; The destroyed model can fight after the attacking unit has finished making its attacks (when doing so, it is assumed to have 1 wound remaining), and is then removed from play."
      },
      "Stratagem§Empyric Severance": {
        "keywords": {
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s",
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "Adeptus Custodes",
            "Talons of the Emperor"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET**: One **ADEPTUS CUSTODES** unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks, and one friendly **ANATHEMA PSYKANA** unit within 6″ of that **ADEPTUS CUSTODES** unit.\n\n**EFFECT**: Until the end of the phase, your unit has the Feel No Pain 4+ ability against Psychic attacks and mortal wounds."
      },
      "Stratagem§Flawless Construction": {
        "keywords": {
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "Solar Spearhead"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s",
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET**: One Adeptus Custodes Vehicle unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT**: Until the end of the phase, each time an attack targets a model in your unit, if the Strength characteristic of that attack is greater than the Toughness characteristic of your unit, subtract 1 from the Wound roll."
      },
      "Stratagem§Gilded Champion": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Adeptus Custodes",
            "Auric Champions"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Any"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Any phase, when a friendly **ADEPTUS CUSTODES CHARACTER** model has used a (Once per battle, per unit) datasheet ability.\n\n**TARGET:** That **ADEPTUS CUSTODES CHARACTER** model.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your model can use that (Once per battle, per unit) datasheet ability one additional time, but not in the same phase.\n\n**RESTRICTIONS:** You cannot use this **stratagem** on the same **ADEPTUS CUSTODES CHARACTER** model more than once per battle."
      },
      "Stratagem§Hunt as One": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Adeptus Custodes",
            "Talons of the Emperor"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Start of your Movement phase.\n\n**TARGET**: Up to two **ADEPTUS CUSTODES** units from your army.\n\n**EFFECT**: Until the end of the turn, your units are eligible to shoot and/or declare a charge in a turn in which they Fell Back.\n\n**RESTRICTIONS**: You can only select two units if one (and only one) of them is an **ANATHEMA PSYKANA** unit and both are within 6″ of each other."
      },
      "Stratagem§Manoeuvre And Fire": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Adeptus Custodes",
            "Aquilan Shield"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase, when a friendly **ADEPTUS CUSTODES** unit is selected to make a **fall-back move**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **ADEPTUS CUSTODES** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** That move does not prevent your unit from being **eligible to shoot/declare a charge**."
      },
      "Stratagem§Multipotentiality": {
        "keywords": {
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "Adeptus Custodes",
            "Shield Host"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Your Movement phase.\n\n**TARGET**: One **Adeptus Custodes** unit from your army Fell Back this phase.\n\n**EFFECT**: Until the end of your turn, that unit is eligible to shoot and declare a charge in a turn in which it Fell Back."
      },
      "Stratagem§Psy-Chaff Volley": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Adeptus Custodes",
            "Null Maiden Vigil"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase, when a friendly **PROSECUTOR SQUAD** unit has shot.\n\n**TARGET:** That **PROSECUTOR SQUAD** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one enemy unit hit by those attacks. That unit is **prosecuted** until the end of the turn:\n\n- Attacks that target a **prosecuted** unit have +1 **AP**."
      },
      "Stratagem§Punishment Inescapable": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Solar Spearhead"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET**: One Adeptus Custodes unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.\n\n**EFFECT**: Until the end of the phase, ranged weapons equipped by models in your unit have the [IGNORES COVER] ability, and until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack, you can ignore any or all modifiers to that attack’s Ballistic Skill characteristic and/or any or all modifiers to the Hit roll."
      },
      "Stratagem§Purgation Sweep": {
        "keywords": {
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "Adeptus Custodes",
            "Null Maiden Vigil"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase, when a friendly **WITCHSEEKER SQUAD** unit is **selected to shoot**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **WITCHSEEKER SQUAD** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit’s **[TORRENT]** attacks have:\n\n- +1 **A**.\n\n- __Or:__ If those attacks target a **PSYKER**/**battle shocked** unit, +2 **A**."
      },
      "Stratagem§Relentless Persecution": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Solar Spearhead"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Your Movement phase, just after an Adeptus Custodes Vehicle unit from your army Advances.\n\n**TARGET**: That Adeptus Custodes Vehicle unit.\n\n**EFFECT**: Until the end of the turn, your unit is eligible to shoot in a turn in which it Advanced. If your unit has the Walker keyword, until the end of the turn, your unit is eligible to shoot and declare a charge in a turn in which it Advanced instead."
      },
      "Stratagem§Shield of Honour": {
        "keywords": {
          "Category": [
            "Epic Deed"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "Adeptus Custodes",
            "Guardians of the Throne"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Start of the Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One friendly **ADEPTUS CUSTODES INFANTRY/MOUNTED** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** When an enemy model **engaged** with your unit selects targets, if that enemy model does __not__ select your unit as the target of __all__ of its attacks, that enemy model’s attacks have:\n\n- -1 to **hit rolls.**\n\n- -1 to **wound rolls**."
      },
      "Stratagem§Swift As The Eagle": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Adeptus Custodes",
            "Guardians of the Throne"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Movement phase, when an enemy unit ends a move within 8\" of a friendly **unengaged** **TRUSTED SENTINEL** unit.\n\n**TARGET:** That **TRUSTED SENTINEL** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit can make a **normal move** of up to D3+3\"."
      },
      "Stratagem§Taloned Pincer": {
        "keywords": {
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "Adeptus Custodes",
            "Talons of the Emperor"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Your opponent’s Movement phase, just after an enemy unit ends a Normal, Advance or Fall Back move.\n\n**TARGET**: Up to two **ADEPTUS CUSTODES** units from your army that are within 9″ of that enemy unit..\n\n**EFFECT**: Your units can make a Normal move of up to 5″.\n\n**RESTRICTIONS**: You cannot select units that are within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units. You can only select two units if one (and only one) of them is an **ANATHEMA PSYKANA** unit and both are within 6″ of each other."
      },
      "Stratagem§Talons Interlocked": {
        "keywords": {
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "Adeptus Custodes",
            "Talons of the Emperor"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET**: Up to two **ADEPTUS CUSTODES INFANTRY** units from your army, and one enemy unit that is an eligible target for all of those units.\n\n**EFFECT**: Until the end of the phase, your units can only target that enemy unit, but each time a model in one of your units makes a ranged attack, improve the Strength and Armour Penetration characteristics. of that attack by 1.\n\n**RESTRICTIONS**: You can only select two units if one (and only one) of them is an **ANATHEMA PSYKANA** unit and both are within 6″ of each other."
      },
      "Stratagem§Unleash The Lions": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Adeptus Custodes",
            "Lions of the Emperor"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Command"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Command phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One friendly **ADEPTUS CUSTODES TERMINATOR** unit that has 2+ models.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit is split into separate units, each containing __one__ model. These new units each have a **starting strength** of 1."
      },
      "Stratagem§Unstoppable": {
        "keywords": {
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "Solar Spearhead"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Start of your Movement phase.\n\n**TARGET**: One Adeptus Custodes Vehicle or Adeptus Custodes Mounted unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT**: Until the end of the phase, models in your unit can move horizontally through models and terrain features."
      },
      "Stratagem§Unwavering Sentinels": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Adeptus Custodes",
            "Shield Host"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
