          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, when an enemy unit targets a friendly **ADEPTUS CUSTODES TERMINATOR** unit.\n\n**TARGET:** That **ADEPTUS CUSTODES TERMINATOR** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Attacks that target your unit have -1 **D** until that enemy unit has attacked."
      },
      "Stratagem§Vigililance Eternal": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Adeptus Custodes",
            "Shield Host"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Command"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Your Movement phase.\n\n**TARGET**: One **Adeptus Custodes Battleline** unit from your army (excluding **Anathema Psykana** units) within range of an objective marker you control.\n\n**EFFECT**: That objective marker remains under your control, even if you have no models within range of it, until your opponent controls it at the start or end of any turn."
      },
      "Stratagem§Wrathful Advance": {
        "keywords": {
