          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Fight phase, just before an Adeptus\nCustodes unit from your army Piles In.\n\n**TARGET**: That Adeptus Custodes unit.\n\n**EFFECT**: Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes a Pile‑in move, it can move up to D3+3\" instead of up to 3\"."
      },
