      "Detachment§Shadowkeepers": {
        "text": "**WARDENS OF THE DARK CELLS**\n\nWhile a friendly **ADEPTUS CUSTODES** unit (excluding **MONSTER/VEHICLE** units) is within range of an **objective**, melee attacks that target that unit with a **S** greater than that unit’s **T** have -1 to **wound rolls**.\n\n**Favoured ka’tah**\n**Kaptaris**\n\n\u0007**Additional Effect:** You can select one enemy unit **engaged** with your unit. That enemy unit must make a **battle-shock roll**, with -1 to that **battle-shock roll**. You cannot select the same enemy unit for this effect more than once per phase.",
        "stats": {
          "Detachment Points": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "keywords": {
          "Role": [
            "Purge The Foe"
          ]
        },
        "rules": {
          "assignStratagems": {
            "actions": [
              {
                "actionType": "add",
                "iterations": 1,
                "paths": [
