        "text": "**MAGNA IMPERATOR**\n\nWhen a friendly **ADEPTUS CUSTODES** unit is selected to attack, that unit’s attacks can:\n\n- Re-roll __one__ **hit roll**.\n\n- Re-roll __one__ **wound roll**.\n\n**Favoured ka’tah**\n**Rendax**\n\n**Additional Effect:** You can select one enemy **MONSTER/VEHICLE** unit **engaged** with your unit and roll one D6:\n\n- On a 1-2, that enemy unit suffers 1 **mortal wound**.\n\n- On a 3-5, that enemy unit suffers D3 **mortal wounds**.\n\n- On a 6, that enemy unit suffers 3 **mortal wounds**.",
