      "Stratagem§Grim Responsibility": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase, when a friendly **ADEPTUS CUSTODES INFANTRY** unit is **selected to fight**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **ADEPTUS CUSTODES** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit’s melee attacks have **[LETHAL HITS: CHARACTER/MONSTER]**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Adeptus Custodes",
            "Shadowkeepers"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Indomitable Guardians": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Fight phase, when an enemy unit has fought.\n\n**TARGET:** One friendly **ADEPTUS CUSTODES** unit that is within range of an **objective** and is **eligible to fight**.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit has **Fights First** and __must__ be the next unit you **select to fight**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Adeptus Custodes",
            "Shadowkeepers"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Emperor’s Domain": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase, when a friendly **TRUSTED SENTINEL** unit is selected to make a **consolidation move**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **TRUSTED SENTINEL** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** You can select the **objective consolidation mode** for that **consolidation move**, regardless of that **consolidation move**’s Before Moving restrictions.\n_This means your unit can move out of _engagement range_ with enemy units, provided it meets the conditions of the _objective consolidation mode_._",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Adeptus Custodes",
            "Honoured Companions"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Advanced Stabilisers": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase, when a friendly **GRAV-ASSAULT** unit is **selected to shoot**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **GRAV-ASSAULT** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit’s ranged attacks have **[ASSAULT]**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Adeptus Custodes",
            "Grav‑Assault Force"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Inevitable Annihilation": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase, when a friendly **GRAV-ASSAULT** unit is **selected to shoot**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **GRAV-ASSAULT** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit can ignore modifiers to your unit’s:\n\n- **BS**.\n\n- **Hit rolls**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Adeptus Custodes",
            "Grav‑Assault Force"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Victory Before Death": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Any phase, when a friendly **GRAV-ASSAULT** unit within range of an **objective** is **destroyed**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **GRAV-ASSAULT** unit. You can target that unit with this **stratagem** even though it is **destroyed**.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one **objective** that:\n\n- Your unit was controlling when it was **destroyed**.\n\n- Has no enemy units (excluding **AIRCRAFT** units) within range of it.\nThat **objective** is **secured**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Adeptus Custodes",
            "Grav‑Assault Force"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Any"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Impenetrable Bastion": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** End of your Movement phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One friendly **ADEPTUS CUSTODES** unit (excluding **MONSTER/VEHICLE** units).\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one **objective** your unit is controlling. That **objective** is **secured**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Adeptus Custodes",
            "Emperor’s Chosen"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§In Auramite clad": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, when an enemy unit targets a friendly **ADEPTUS CUSTODES** unit (excluding **CUSTODIAN WARDENS** units).\n\n**TARGET:** That **ADEPTUS CUSTODES** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Attacks that target your unit have -1 **AP** until that enemy unit has attacked.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Adeptus Custodes",
            "Guardians of the Throne"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
