      "Stratagem§Unceasing Onslaught": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase, when a friendly **ADEPTUS CUSTODES DREADNOUGHT** unit ends an **advance move**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **ADEPTUS CUSTODES DREADNOUGHT** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** - Your unit’s ranged attacks have **[ASSAULT]** until the end of the turn.\n\n- That move does not prevent your unit from being **eligible to declare a charge**.",
