      "Stratagem§Honoured Interred": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One friendly **ADEPTUS CUSTODES DREADNOUGHT** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit has the following ability:\n**Honoured Interred (Aura):** Friendly **ADEPTUS CUSTODES** units within 6\" of this unit can re-roll **hit rolls** of 1.",
