          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Unstoppable momentum": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement/Charge phase, when a friendly **ADEPTUS CUSTODES DREADNOUGHT** unit is **selected to move** or **declares a charge**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **ADEPTUS CUSTODES DREADNOUGHT** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit has **MOBILE**.",
        "keywords": {
