          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Charge",
            "Movement"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Fury of the Emperor": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Charge phase, when a friendly **ADEPTUS CUSTODES TERMINATOR** unit that made an **ingress move** this turn is selected to **declare a charge**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **ADEPTUS CUSTODES TERMINATOR** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit has +2 to **charge rolls**.",
