          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Charge"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Lightning Wrath": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase, when a friendly **ADEPTUS CUSTODES** unit is selected to make a **pile-in move**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **ADEPTUS CUSTODES** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** When making that **pile-in move**, your unit can move up to D3+3\".",
