      "Stratagem§Preternatural Rapidity": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase, when a friendly **ADEPTUS CUSTODES** unit ends an **advance move**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **ADEPTUS CUSTODES** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** That **advance move** does not prevent your unit from being **eligible to declare a charge**.",
        "keywords": {
