      "Stratagem§Inexorable": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase, when a friendly **ADEPTUS CUSTODES** unit is **selected to move**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **ADEPTUS CUSTODES** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the turn, your unit can ignore modifiers to your unit’s:\n\n-  **M**.\n\n- **Advance rolls** and **charge rolls**.",
        "keywords": {
