      "Stratagem§Gravimetric Grenade": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Start of your opponent’s Charge phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One friendly **unengaged** **ADEPTUS CUSTODES** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one **visible** enemy unit within 12\" of your unit. When that enemy unit **declares a charge**, that enemy unit has -1 to **charge rolls**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Adeptus Custodes",
            "Solar Watch"
          ],
          "Turn": [
