      "Stratagem§At Spear’s Length": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase, when a friendly **ADEPTUS CUSTODES** unit is selected to make a **fall-back move**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **ADEPTUS CUSTODES** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** That **fall-back move** does not prevent your unit from being **eligible to shoot**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Adeptus Custodes",
            "Solar Watch"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
