      "Stratagem§Duty Unto Death": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase, when an enemy unit targets a friendly **ADEPTUS CUSTODES** unit.\n\n**TARGET:** That **ADEPTUS CUSTODES** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** When a model in your unit is **destroyed**, if your unit has not been **selected to fight** this phase, roll one D6, with +1 to that roll if that model is a **CHARACTER** model:\n\n- On a 3+, do not remove that model from the battlefield. When your unit has fought, or at the end of the phase (whichever comes first), that model is removed from the battlefield.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Adeptus Custodes",
            "Auric Champions"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Bearers of His Light": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase, when a friendly **ADEPTUS CUSTODES** unit is **selected to fight**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **ADEPTUS CUSTODES** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit’s melee attacks can ignore modifiers to **hit rolls** and **wound rolls**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Adeptus Custodes",
            "Emissaries Imperatus"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Selfless Service": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** End of your opponent’s Charge phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One friendly **unengaged** **ADEPTUS CUSTODES** unit within 6\" of an enemy unit. You can only select a **VEHICLE** unit if it is a **CHARACTER/WALKER** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** **Declare a charge** with your unit:\n\n- When making the **charge roll**, if the result is greater than 6 (after modifiers), change it to 6.\n\n- When selecting **charge targets**, you can select __any__ enemy units that are within 6\" of your unit and within the **maximum distance**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Adeptus Custodes",
            "Emissaries Imperatus"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Charge"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Slayers of Nightmares": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase, when a friendly **ADEPTUS CUSTODES** unit is **selected to fight**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **ADEPTUS CUSTODES** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit’s melee attacks that target a unit with a **T** greater than this unit’s **T** have +1 to **wound rolls**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Adeptus Custodes",
