          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Prime Target": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase, when a friendly **ADEPTUS CUSTODES** unit is **selected to shoot**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **ADEPTUS CUSTODES** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit’s ranged attacks can:\n\n- Re-roll __one__ **hit roll**.\n\n- Re-roll __one__ **wound roll**.\n\n- Re-roll __one__ **damage roll**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Adeptus Custodes",
            "Guardians of the Throne"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Unlimited Endurance": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase, when a friendly **ADEPTUS CUSTODES** unit ends an **advance move**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **ADEPTUS CUSTODES** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the turn:\n\n- Your unit’s ranged attacks have **[ASSAULT]**.\n\n- That **advance move** does not prevent your unit from being **eligible to declare a charge**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Adeptus Custodes",
            "Guardians of the Throne"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Rapid Reactions": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Movement phase, when an enemy unit ends a **fall-back move**.\n\n**TARGET:** One friendly **ADEPTUS CUSTODES INFANTRY** unit that was **engaged** with that enemy unit at the start of the phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit shoots using **normal shooting**, but while doing so your unit can only target that enemy unit.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Adeptus Custodes",
            "Aquilan Shield"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Tip of the Talon": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase, when a friendly **ADEPTUS CUSTODES** unit is **selected to shoot**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **ADEPTUS CUSTODES** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit’s ranged attacks that target an enemy unit within 9\" of your unit have +1 **S**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Adeptus Custodes",
            "Aquilan Shield"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§No Escape": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Movement phase, when an enemy unit ends a **fall-back move**.\n\n**TARGET:** One friendly **unengaged** **ADEPTUS CUSTODES INFANTRY** unit that is within 6\" of that enemy unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** **Declare a charge** with your unit. When selecting **charge targets**, you can only select enemy units that made a **fall-back move** this phase and are within the **maximum distance**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Adeptus Custodes",
            "Shadowkeepers"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Golden Light of the Moiraides": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase, when a friendly **ADEPTUS CUSTODES** unit is selected to make an **ingress move**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **ADEPTUS CUSTODES** Unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the start of your next turn: \n\n- Attacks that target your unit have -1 to **hit rolls**.\n\n- Enemy units cannot target your unit with **snap shooting** attacks.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Adeptus Custodes",
            "Dread Host"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        }
      },
