      "Ability§Take Wing": {
        "text": "At the end of your opponent’s Fight phase, if this unit is **unengaged**, you can place this unit in **strategic reserves**."
      },
      "Ability§Neutronium Cascade Mine": {
        "text": "_Once per battle, per unit_\n\nAt the start of any phase, you can select one enemy unit within 3\" of this unit and roll one D6. On a 2+:\n\n- That enemy unit suffers D3 **mortal wounds**.\n\n- Or: If that enemy unit is a **VEHICLE/MONSTER** unit, that enemy unit suffers 2D3 **mortal wounds**."
      },
      "Ability§Strike from the Skies": {
        "text": "In your Shooting phase, if this unit made an **ingress move** this turn, this unit’s ranged attacks can re-roll **hit rolls**."
      },
