      "Ability§Aegis of the Emperor": {
        "text": "Friendly ^^**Adeptus Custodes**^^ units with this ability have Feel No Pain 5+ against **mortal wounds**."
      },
      "Ability§Aquila Commander": {
        "text": "At the start of the battle round, if a model with this ability is your ^^**Warlord**^^, gain 1CP."
      },
      "Ability§Master of Ka’tahs": {
        "text": "_Once per battle round, per unit_\n\nIf this unit is not readied, you can use this ability. If you do, this unit is **readied**."
      },
      "Ability§Vengeful Surge": {
        "text": "_Once per battle, per unit_\n\nIn your opponent’s Shooting phase, when an enemy unit has shot, if a model in this unit lost a wound as a result of those attacks, this unit can make a surge move of up to D6+2\"."
      },
      "Ability§Archeotech Teleport-shunter": {
        "text": "_Once per battle, per unit_\n\nIn your Movement phase, if this unit is unengaged and has not been selected to move this phase, you can use this ability. If you do, place this unit in strategic reserves and this unit must make an ingress move this phase."
      },
      "Ability§Slayer of Tyrants": {
        "text": "This unit’s melee attacks that target a unit with a **T** greater than this unit’s **T** have +1 to wound rolls."
      },
      "Ability§Unyielding Ancient (Contemptor-Achillus Dreadnought)": {
        "text": "Attacks that target this unit with a **S** greater than this unit’s **T** have -1 to wound rolls."
      },
      "Ability§Destructor Optics": {
        "text": "This unit’s ranged attacks that target a unit (excluding **MONSTER**/**VEHICLE** units) have +1 **AP**."
      },
      "Ability§Repulsor Suspensor Technology": {
        "text": "_Once per phase, per unit_\n\nIn your opponent’s Shooting phase, when an enemy unit has shot, if this unit lost a wound as a result of those attacks and is unengaged, this unit can make a normal move of up to D6\"."
      },
      "Ability§Assault Vehicle": {
        "text": "In your Movement phase, when this unit ends an advance move, units embarked within this unit can make a shock disembark move."
      },
      "Ability§Unyielding Ancient (Contemptor-Galatus Dreadnought)": {
        "text": "Attacks that target this unit with a **S** greater than this unit’s **T** have -1 to wound rolls."
      },
      "Ability§Mobile Hunter": {
        "text": "In your Shooting phase, when this unit has shot, you can use this ability. If you do:\n\n- This unit can make a normal move of up to D6\".\n\n- This unit is not eligible to declare a charge until the end of the turn."
      },
      "Ability§Sword of the Throne": {
        "text": "At the start of the first battle round, select one enemy unit to be this model’s **mark**:\n\n- This model’s attacks that target this model’s **mark** have +1 to wound rolls.\n\n- Each time this model’s **mark** is destroyed, select one enemy unit to be this model’s **mark**."
      },
      "Ability§Impenetrable Defence": {
        "text": "This unit’s attacks have [sustained Hits 1: non-Monster/Vehicle] if any of the following apply:\n\n- This unit is within range of an objective.\n\n- The target of those attacks is within range of an **objective**."
      },
      "Ability§Swift Ruin": {
        "text": "_Once per phase, per army_\n\nYou can target this unit with the Rapid Ingress **stratagem**, regardless of any other uses of that **stratagem** this phase. If you do:\n\n- That use is -1 CP.\n\n- That use does not prevent any uses of that **stratagem** on other units this phase."
      },
      "Ability§Dread Foe (Aquilon Terminators with Solarite Power Gauntlets)": {
        "text": "This unit’s melee attacks that target a unit (excluding **MONSTER**/**VEHICLE** units) have +1 **AP**."
      }
    },
